Fedora fork: hide menu entries that cannot work on Fedora: Reset Computer
(omarchy-system-factory-reset rebuilds a Limine/mkinitcpio install), AUR (no
AUR; Install > Package already lists every configured repository) and the
update channels (pacman repositories; Omadora follows one pinned upstream
commit).

